
 >> x := Yam-khoom tshiab.
 >> y := Yam-khoom tshiab.
 >> z := x.
 Tawm sau-ntawv: ( x zoo-ib-yam: y ), kab-tshiab.
 Tawm sau-ntawv: ( x zoo-ib-yam: z ), kab-tshiab.
 Tawm sau-ntawv: ( x = y ), kab-tshiab.
 Tawm sau-ntawv: ( x = z ), kab-tshiab.
 Tawm sau-ntawv: ( x ≠ y ), kab-tshiab.
 Tawm sau-ntawv: ( x ≠ z ), kab-tshiab.
 